{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally's Health and Lifestyle Column"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "You Won't Believe It!"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Speculating about Feelings and Impressions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you speculate about something, you are making a guess based on what you know about the situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can show you are speculating about something by using a modal, like <span class =\"italic\">must</span> or <span class =\"italic\">can't</span>.  The modal is followed by a verb."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The verb can be in the Present tense or the Present Perfect tense."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Psychologists must find this issue very intriguing, because many studies have been done on the subject.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "This can't be just a coincidence. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Conditional Sentences "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will do something. In that condition, something else may or will (not) happen.<br/><br/>The parts of the sentence are divided into two clauses: the <span class =\"italic\">If</span> clause and the <span class =\"italic\">Condition</span> clause.<br/><br/>The <span class=\"strong\">if</span>  clause can go at the start or the end of the sentence.  The <span class=\"strong\">if</span> clause is in <span class=\"strong\">Present Tense</span>.  The condition clause goes in <span class=\"italic\">future</span> <span class=\"strong\">will</span> or with the modal verbs <span class=\"strong\">might</span> or  <span class=\"strong\">may</span> + a verb in infinitive. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">1st Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">2nd Clause</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If you ask two people to remember an address, \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a person might try to picture the house and street.  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible you ask two people to remember an address. In this condition: a person might try to picture the house and street.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A different person may try to remember the sound of the spoken address \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"if you ask the same question.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible you ask the question to somebody else. In this condition: a different person may try to remember the sound of the spoken address.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you ask two people to remember an address, a person might try to picture the house and street."}, {"type": "example", "content": "A different person may try to remember the sound of the spoken address if you ask the same question."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "intriguing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "makes you interested or curious"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Psychologists have found this issue so intriguing that many studies have been done on the subject.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le02ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about the human senses."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "