 {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "_data": [], "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": ""}, {"time": "100", "text": "Have you ever wondered why it is that people look up when they are thinking? Psychologists must find this issue very intriguing, because many studies have been done on the subject.", "id": 1, "image": ""}, {"time": "9500", "text": "Most people relate to their surroundings through one main sense \u2013 usually sight, hearing, or touch. The other senses are smell and taste. The words that people choose can provide a hint as to which sense they relate to. For instance, a visually-oriented person might say, \"I see what you mean,\" whereas a hearing-oriented person might very well say, \"I hear what you're saying.\" This choice of words can't be just a coincidence.", "id": 2, "image": ""}, {"time": "37250", "text": "When a person is trying to find an answer, he or she will use one of the three main senses to find the solution. If you ask a person to remember an address, he might try to picture the house and street. A different person may try to remember the sound of the spoken address if you ask the same question.  Psychologists can detect through eye movements which sense a person is using before the person even says anything.", "id": 3, "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn7le02ob09re1vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "id": 2}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}